        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Events - Dimension A (copy)_399131548576399377]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Overall&apos; THEN &apos;&apos;&#10;  WHEN &apos;Region&apos; THEN [region]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Country Name&apos; THEN [country_name]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Brand Name&apos; THEN [brand_name]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Entity ID&apos; THEN [entity_id]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Vendor Grade&apos; THEN [vendor_grade]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Vertical Type&apos; THEN [vertical_type]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Client Name&apos; THEN [client_name]&#10;  WHEN &apos;POS Integration Type&apos; THEN [pos_integration_type]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Automation Group&apos; THEN [automation_group]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Persona&apos; THEN [persona]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Operation Type&apos; THEN [operation_type]&#10;  WHEN &apos;Change Type&apos; THEN [change_type]&#10;END' />
